WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:38.680
K-Kirika-senpai!

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:42.640
He came! He really came! He...

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.400
Karin-chan…

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.270
What's wrong with her?..

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.690
I can't let him see me in these clothes.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.110
Karin-chan…

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:58.400
She's going shiko…

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:04.330
He said he'd come no matter what… but I can't show him these clothes!

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.000
Excuse me.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.030
Is Karin-chan here?

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:15.540
Get ready,
Dancing School Festival

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.930
What to do, what to do…

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.510
There's no way I can meet him looking like this!

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.900
I want to go and see the school festival.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.780
Get close to the amateur goddess.
Look for an opening.

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:48.960
Your order?

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.210
Kujyou-kun.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:02:59.920
Karin's not here.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.470
I don't really understand why, but it looks like Kazune-kun's saving me!

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:05.760
You have my thanks.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:18.860
I see.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.280
Well then, it can't be helped.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:26.740
I'll look for her elsewhere. Thanks Kujyou-kun.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.830
Thanks for visiting!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.000
Hey Karin, it's alright now.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.510
If you're looking for Karin-chan… she went outside…

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:43.640
Huh?

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:48.930
I escaped safely. Now all I need to do is go to the classroom and change into my uniform.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.650
K-Kirika-senpai!

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:06.450
The ring is reacting a little… is Karin-chan close?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:11.790
Why is he coming this way?! He was just in the classroom!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:19.460
I absolutely can't be seen in this embarrassing costume!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.730
Stay away…

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.360
Please don't let him find me…

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.920
Jin-kun's stage has started!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.430
Hurry, hurry!

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.220
Huh?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.500
What a cool looking guy.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.260
So he's called Jin-kun…

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.220
An idol…

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.890
Wait, this isn't the time to be watching!

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.530
What should I do?..

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:14.410
What are you doing crawling around?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.410
You girls! You're the Kazunezu!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.080
Damn it!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.250
We've been discovered!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.090
Jin-kun!

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.560
She's nowhere to be found…

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:43.690
However… what is that skin-colored thing that keeps running by me?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:48.320
Karin-chan!

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.030
She's not here…

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:57.120
Hey, hey, Kazune-chan, look! Fish scooping!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:59.290
Yeah, later okay?

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:05.500
Ah, look! Choco bananas! They look yummy…

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:07.920
We're not kids anymo-

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:10.300
Huh?

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.260
Eating already…

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.270
This one's for Kazune-chan!

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:23.150
Yummy, isn't it?

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.610
There's some chocolate on your mouth.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:33.200
Thanks, Kazune-chan.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.500
Kujyou-kun!

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.790
What!?

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:49.840
Kujyou-kun!

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.470
What the heck are you doing?!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:05.440
I have to get back to the classroom to get changed!

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:08.690
Sakuragaoka Beautiful Boy Contest!

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:12.990
The winner is… Kujyou Kazune-kun!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.860
Eh, Kazune?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.490
Kazune-kun…

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.670
Kujyou-kun!

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.670
You're the best!

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.830
Ah, Karin-chan!

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:30.460
It's amazing, Kazune-kun got first place!

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.380
Kazune-kun did?

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:38.470
And… for the Beautiful Girl Contest, the winner is Kujyou Himeka-san!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:43.060
Himeka-chan too!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.360
Why am I doing this?..

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.890
Those two look good together!

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.280
That girl's costume is cute!

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.700
Kazune-kun! Himeka-chan!

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:01.870
Hey! Over here! Here! Kazune-kun!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.500
- Himeka-chan!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:02.660
- Karin!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.160
It's Karin-chan!

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:09.540
Congratulations! You two did it! Congratulations!

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:15.340
I'm glad I'm friends with you two!

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:16.260
Not good!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.590
- Congratulations!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.590
- It's him.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:22.640
She's funny!

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.770
Kirika-senpai!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.240
I have to run!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.490
Sorry, hold this!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.820
Kazune-chan…

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:41.930
What's happen?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.420
Karin… where did you go?

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:54.710
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.250
I am God!

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.210
You moron.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:03.210
It's a croquette!

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:54.480
I'll stay here and hide for a while so senpai doesn't find me.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.110
Excuse me…

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:03.120
Dosukoi! Dosukoi! Dosukoi!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.120
Where's the student council office?

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.410
What should I do?..

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.290
Are you… alone?

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:22.390
Why don't you guide her? You're a mini-goddess after all!

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:27.350
Leave her be, leave her be! As a goddess your appearance is important!

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.020
What would you do if you get seen by senpai?!

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:39.070
- Not yet! Not yet! Not yet!

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:39.070
- Not yet! Not yet! Not yet!

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.990
I can't! I can't just leave her!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.870
I win!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.710
Alright, let's go!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:56.100
Alright, senpai isn't here…

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:59.190
Kirio's House

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:08.170
Student Council Office

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:03.560
Okay, this is it.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.490
Okay, thanks.

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:06.360
Bye!

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.000
Ah, the first guest!

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:20.300
Welcome.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:21.750
Kirio-chan!

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.220
You… why?

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.760
That looks good on you, Kirio-chan…

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:32.890
I wanted to see your haunted house no matter what.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.140
Ouch…

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:52.330
H-Himeka-chan! Are you alright?

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:08.380
Huh? Again?

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:13.810
Karin-chan, I've been looking for you.

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:18.770
Himeka-chan, did you show those clothes to the guy you like?

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:20.900
Yeah.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:30.660
He said this one was much better, he seemed happy, and gave me a very gentle smile.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.790
Thanks, Karin-chan.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.370
That's great!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.250
Kirika-senpai's coming again!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:46.170
Ah, Karin-chan! This…

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:51.640
Why does Kirika-senpai seem know exactly where I'm going to go?

00:14:57.270 --> 00:15:01.940
Anyway, I've got to get to the classroom… no, somewhere I can hide!

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.150
Karin! Over here!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:05.860
Kazune-kun…

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:27.460
Is this a classroom?.. This is the boys' locker room!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:31.430
There wasn't anyone in here, sorry to be sudden.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.260
Well, you saved me but…

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.650
K-K-Kazune-kun!

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.190
You can't meet him in those clothes, right?

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.190
Himeka said you switched with her.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:50.990
Y-Yeah…

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.120
If these are okay with you, wear them.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.030
Here.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.250
As long as you don't mind them like this.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.170
Okay, I'm leaving.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.590
H-Hey, wait!

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.880
What? If you don't want to, it's fine.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:15.390
T-That's not it, if I get back into the corridor from here, I could run into Kirika-senpai again.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:19.140
And it'll be a problem if other boys come in while I'm changing.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.980
Will you watch the door, Kazune-kun?

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.650
Ah, sure.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:29.320
Boy's Locker Room

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.320
Hey! Not done yet?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.650
Almost there!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.280
Geez, girls are so slow.

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.740
If you don't come out in ten seconds, I'm opening the door.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.710
I never noticed…

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:51.010
I didn't think that our heights were that different.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:56.010
Kazune-kun is this tall…

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.220
Kazune-kun's scent…

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.230
It makes me feel relaxed…

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.270
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.730
You're finally done…

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.660
As expected, it looks a lot better on you.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.040
Come on, hurry up and go find him.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:23.660
Yeah!

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.110
Karin-chan.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.610
Kirika-senpai!

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.400
We finally meet.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:01.160
Let's go, we can dance too.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.410
Okay.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:09.920
Wow!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.130
They're beautiful.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:14.350
Kujyou-kun!

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.340
Where's Kujyou-kun?

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:20.260
I thought we'd finally get to dance too…

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.080
Kazune-chan.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.700
Ah, Himeka.

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:52.590
Hey, Kazune-chan should go too.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:57.470
Aren't you going to dance in the folk dance?

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.640
I'll stay here.

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.850
I see.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:21.740
Then… I'll stay with you.

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:51.810
Hey, hey, Shii-chan!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:57.070
Kirika-senpai was really kind, and when we danced, he led perfectly!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.650
Stop Karin-chan…

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.700
Today was great!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.940
It hurts!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.410
Ah, sorry.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.500
Kirika-senpai…

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:17.380
I'm happy for you, but it's all thanks to Kazune-kun.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:17.960
Huh?

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:24.010
Because Kazune-kun lent you clothes, things went well with Kirika-senpai.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:26.720
Right.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:33.690
What is it?

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:38.980
I thought I'd thank you for today.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.040
Thanks.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.650
Is that it?

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:47.580
A-And I'm going to wash the clothes you lent me.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:48.530
Yeah.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:53.670
By the way, during the folk dance, your fan club was looking for you.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:55.570
Where'd you go Kazune-kun?

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:57.750
That's none of your business!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.220
I come to thank you, and you give me this attitude!

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:05.680
Shut up! This is why girls are-

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:10.680
What! Idiot Kazune! Kirika-senpai is much better!

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.890
You should just stay pickled up in your room!

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.150
Sorry for being a pickle.

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:26.700
Is this the amateur goddess' ring?

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.120
To get it this easily…

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:31.180
You did well Kirika.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.290
With this, Kujyou will…

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.250
…the Sun God will be smashed.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:39.460
Even if it wasn't right now,…

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:43.720
…you have a bad habit of rushing things.

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:46.130
What're you scared about?

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:48.390
We don't have time!

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:52.850
Or… have you fallen in love?

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.230
What're you saying?!

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:58.060
I'm just worried about…

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:01.690
Kirio-chan. Kirika-chan.

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:07.820
You're awake. Are you alright?

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:09.780
You should be sleeping.

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:15.120
Today was fun. I'd like to go outside again.

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:24.140
I'm sorry. Just a bit more, wait a bit more… Himeka.

00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:25.010
I'm sorry. Just a bit more, wait a bit more… Himeka.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:11.210
The Ring has disappeared

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:07.690
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.690 --> 00:24:10.070
The ring has disappeared!

00:24:10.070 --> 00:24:12.610
Ah, the school festival ended…

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:15.280
As expected Kirika-senpai is really cool!

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:16.740
Ah, it isn't the time for this!

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:19.330
My treasured ring is gone!
